WEBVTT

00:08:57.569 --> 00:09:00.809
U Severnoj Koreji,
to sam uradio sam.

00:09:00.809 --> 00:09:03.522
Nada me je dovela u Ameriku.

00:09:03.522 --> 00:09:06.522
Ali u Americi nisam znao
šta da radim,

00:09:06.522 --> 00:09:11.554
jer sam imao ovu neverovatnu slobodu.

00:09:11.554 --> 00:09:15.605
Moj hranitelj mi je dao pravac
za tom večerom

00:09:15.605 --> 00:09:19.131
i motivisao me je i dao mi je svrhu

00:09:19.131 --> 00:09:23.058
života u Americi.

00:09:23.058 --> 00:09:26.178
Ovde nisam došao sam.

00:09:26.178 --> 00:09:31.132
Imao sam nadu,
ali nada sama po sebi nije dovoljna.